        {
          "source_id": "team5863",
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "heading": "Protocol for DNA extraction from PCR diagnostics paper (Toda et al, 2014)",
          "original_text": "Adult females were homogenized individually in 10 μl of lysis buffer including 9 μl of \nSTE buffer [100 mM NaCl, 1 mM EDTA (pH 8.0), 10 mM Tris–HCl (pH 8.0)], and 1 μl of \nproteinase K (10 mg/ml). The homogenate was incubated for 15 min at 65 °C and then \nheated for 5 min at 95 °C to inactivate the proteinase K . PCR was per-formed in 20 ul \nreaction volume, containing 20 pmol of each primer, 10 mM Tris–HCl (pH 8.3), 50 mM \nKCl, 2.5 mM MgCl2, 0.25 mM of each dNTP, and 0.5 units of Taq-polymerase \n(AmpliTaq Gold, Applied Biosystems). The PCR program in the DNA thermal cycler \n(DNA thermal cycler 2720, PE Applied Biosystems) was 94°C for 9 min as a preheat \nstep, followed by 35 cycles at 94°C for 30 s, 52°C for 30 s, and 72°C for 1 min, and then \n72 °C for 7 min as a final extension.",
          "body_characters": 792,
          "reason_code": "literature_protocol_not_dated_local_diary",
          "reason": "文献协议摘录，不是本团队明确日期的已执行实验日记；过去式描述不能据此认作本地实际操作。"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "team5863",
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "heading": "Protocol for DNA extraction from LAMP diagnostics paper (Toda et al, 2015)",
          "original_text": "Place one individual Scirtothrips dorsalis insect into a 0.2 ml PCR tube (using a fine-\ntipped brush). Add 10 µl of 100 mM Tris-HCl (pH 8.0) to the tube. Grind the insect \nthoroughly in this solution (using a fine-tipped brush or a heat-modified pipette tip as \nmentioned previously). Heat the homogenate at 99.9°C for 10 minutes. The resulting \nsupernatant/lysate containing the DNA is then used directly as the template for the \nLAMP reaction (0.5 µl of this extract was used per 20 µl LAMP reaction).",
          "body_characters": 503,
          "reason_code": "literature_protocol_not_dated_local_diary",
          "reason": "文献协议摘录，命令式步骤，没有本地执行日期或作者。"
        }
      ]
    }
